   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ZIBF 01-03</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ZIBF Book Fair 01-03</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Den &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;ls&#xe4;ttningen &#xe4;r att st&#xe4;rka boksektorn i Afrika. Regionalt st&#xf6;d till bokn&#xe4;tv&#xe4;rk i Afrika kan st&#xe4;rka ekonomisk integration och &#xf6;ka handelsm&#xf6;jligheterna och boksektorn i sig. Fr&#xe4;mjandet av l&#xe4;sande &#xe4;r ett viktigt komplement till utbildningssektorn.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of this support is to strengthen the book sector in Africa. Regional support to book networks in Africa will strengthen economic integration and increase the trade possibilities and the book sector as such. Promotion of reading is an important complement to the education sector.</narrative>
  </description>
